# Enquiry form delivery.
#
# The site uses Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com) because static hosting has
# no backend to send mail from. A working access key is already committed in
# src/consts.ts, so the form works out of the box with no setup.
#
# Web3Forms access keys are public by design — they ship in the page HTML and
# can only deliver to the address the key was registered to. They cannot be
# used to read past submissions or change the destination.
#
# Set this only if you want to point a given environment at a different
# Web3Forms account or inbox.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
